{
  "about": "Every Urdu clip the Elderly Companion app plays. A line about a person plays their name clip first (recorded by an admin), then the phrase. 'variants' m/f: one recording each for a man and a woman (the person the line is about). 'reviewed': kept by the owner in the Urdu review (27 Oct 2026); the others need that review. Files: ur_<id>[_m|_f].wav in this folder; scripts/clips.mjs makes placeholders and checks real recordings.",
